<header>
  <div class=3D"wrap">
    <h1 class=3D"name">Faith Ndungwa Mwanzi</h1>
    <span class=3D"role">Finance &amp; Grants Manager</span>
    <p class=3D"summary">
      Four years managing donor-funded programmes across Kenya =E2=80=94 fi=
nancial
      reporting, budget monitoring, payroll and statutory compliance, and
      audit-ready record keeping for projects backed by international and
      national partners.
    </p>
