>financial reports delivered</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<div class=3D"wrap">

  <section id=3D"skills">
    <h2 class=3D"section-title">Skills</h2>

    <div class=3D"skill-group">
      <h3>Donor compliance &amp; reporting</h3>
      <ul class=3D"skill-list">
        <li>Grants management &amp; fiscal hosting</li>
        <li>Donor financial reporting</li>
        <li>Budget monitoring &amp; variance analysis</li>
        <li>Multi-county programme coordination</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class=3D"skill-group">
      <h3>Financial operations</h3>
      <ul class=3D"skill-list">
        <li>Payroll administration</li>
        <li>Statutory compliance (PAYE, SHA, NSSF, NHIF)</li>
        <li>Cash flow management</li>
        <li>General ledger management</li>
        <li>Audit coordination &amp; preparation</li>
        <li>Financial risk management</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class=3D"skill-group">
      <h3>Tools</h3>
      <ul class=3D"skill-list">
        <li>Advanced Microsoft Excel</li>
        <li>QuickBooks</li>
        <li>Kujabuild ERP (ADESO)</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id=3D"experience">
    <h2 class=3D"section-title">Experience</h2>

    <div class=3D"job">
      <div class=3D"when">Jan 2026 =E2=80=93<br>Present</div>
      <div>
        <h3>Finance Manager</h3>
        <div class=3D"org">We Reach NGO</div>
        <ul>
          <li>Oversee finances for 9 donor-funded projects with combined an=
nual budgets exceeding KES 20 million.</li>
          <li>Prepare monthly financial reports, budget utilisation reports=
, and cash flow forecasts using Kujabuild ERP.</li>
          <li>Run budget-versus-actual variance analysis and recommend impr=
ovements to resource utilisation.</li>
          <li>Process payroll and remit statutory deductions (PAYE, SHA, NS=
SF, Housing Levy) with full compliance.</li>
          <li>Coordinate reporting across funding partners and maintain aud=
it-ready financial records.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class=3D"job">
      <div class=3D"when">Jun 2025 =E2=80=93<br>Present</div>
      <div>
        <h3>Finance Officer <span style=3D"font-weight:400;color:var(--ink-=
soft);font-size:13px;">(part-time)</span></h3>
        <div class=3D"org">Rural to Global Organization</div>
        <ul>
          <li>Record and reconcile financial transactions in QuickBooks for=
 internationally funded projects.</li>
          <li>Prepare monthly financial reports and expenditure summaries f=
or donor stakeholders.</li>
          <li>Monitor expenditure trends and funding utilisation with progr=
amme teams.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class=3D"job">
      <div class=3D"when">Dec 2023 =E2=80=93<br>Dec 2025</div>
      <div>
        <h3>Finance &amp; Administration Officer</h3>
        <div class=3D"org">We Reach NGO</div>
        <ul>
          <li>Managed financial records, cashbooks, and monthly bank reconc=
iliations in QuickBooks.</li>
          <li>Prepared donor financial reports and supported budget monitor=
ing.</li>
          <li>Maintained fixed asset registers and procurement financial re=
cords; supported audit preparation.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class=3D"job">
      <div class=3D"when">Jan 2019 =E2=80=93<br>Dec 2020</div>
      <div>
        <h3>Finance &amp; Administration Intern</h3>
        <div class=3D"org">Kakamega County Widow Empowerment Project</div>
        <ul>
          <li>Supported financial record management, payment processing, an=
d bank reconciliations.</li>
          <li>Assisted with financial reporting and payroll compliance docu=
mentation.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id=3D"work">
    <h2 class=3D"section-title">Featured work</h2>
    <div class=3D"work-grid">

      <div class=3D"sheet">
        <div class=3D"tag">QUARTERLY DONOR REPORT</div>
        <h3>Multi-year financial report &amp; transaction tracker</h3>
        <p>
          A full donor reporting workbook: quarterly transaction logs, budg=
et-versus-actual
          by line item, currency reconciliation, and a payment request summ=
ary across a
          three-year grant term.
        </p>
        <div class=3D"meta">Format: Excel workbook, 20+ linked sheets</div>
      </div>

      <div class=3D"sheet">
        <div class=3D"tag">BUDGET VS ACTUAL</div>
        <h3>Grant budget tracker with monthly utilisation</h3>
        <p>
          Category-level budget tracker mapping approved amounts against mo=
nthly actuals,
          with automatic balance and percent-utilised calculations across a=
 16-month
          subaward term.
        </p>
        <div class=3D"meta">Format: Excel workbook, category and summary vi=
ews</div>
      </div>

    </div>
    <p class=3D"note">Sample reports shown are based on real work; organisa=
tion names, project names, and personnel have been replaced with placeholde=
rs to protect donor and partner confidentiality.</p>
  </section>

